OL,3,GNEWSASinfield visits Leeds Rhinos
OL,4,Aduring epic challenge
OL,5,
OL,6,FSir Kevin Sinfield has visited his
OL,7,Fformer Leeds Rhinos home during the
OL,8,Flatest leg of his endurance challenge
OL,9,Fto raise money for motor neurone
OL,10,Fdisease (MND) causes.
OL,12,FThe club legend is aiming to complete
OL,13,Fseven ultramarathons in seven days,
OL,14,Finspired by his friend and teammate Rob
OL,15,FBurrow, who died in 2024 after living
OL,16,Fwith the disease for more than four
OL,17,Fyears.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBYrk Lincs NewsCReg TVFWeather
FL,383,380,200,160,0,100
