OL,3,GNEWSASinfield visits Leeds Rhinos
OL,4,Aduring epic challenge
OL,5,
OL,6,FSinfield kicked off the fourth stage at
OL,7,Fthe DIY Kitchens Stadium in Wakefield
OL,8,Fon Wednesday morning, visited
OL,9,FHeadingley in Leeds, Odsal Stadium in
OL,10,FBradford and finished at the Accu
OL,11,FStadium in Huddersfield at about 16:00.
OL,13,FThe fundraiser and his team have raised
OL,14,Fmore than #11m for the MND community
OL,15,Fsince his first annual challenge in
OL,16,F2020.
OL,23,APub: 30-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
